        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Pull the Quotable Lines Out of an Interview\n\nPicks up to five verbatim quotes from a recorded interview that make sense on their own. Exact wording matters, because a paraphrased quote cannot be published.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Recording\" input goes to \"Extract audio\", and \"Transcribe\" converts the speech to English text. \"Agent\" selects quotes that stand alone without changing a word, and gives fewer than five if fewer qualify. \"Output\" lists them.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"Transcribe\" and \"Agent\", then edit the system prompt on \"Agent\" to ask for three quotes under 20 words each."
        },
